OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry, clear 
OL,6,Fand cold night for most, with light    
OL,7,Fwinds. This will allow a widespread    
OL,8,Ffrost to develop, with the odd patch   
OL,9,Fof freezing mist and fog forming.      
OL,11,CSaturday:FA crisp and clear morning,   
OL,12,Fany freezing fog patches will slowly   
OL,13,Fclear. Bright and sunny afternoon,     
OL,14,Fwith light winds, but still feeling    
OL,15,Fcool, with temperatures remaining in   
OL,16,Fthe single digits.                     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
