OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMilder  
OL,6,Fcompared to previous days with sunny   
OL,7,Fspells and isolated coastal showers on 
OL,8,FSunday. Cool but sunny on Monday.      
OL,9,FCloudier and breezier by Tuesday, with 
OL,10,Foutbreaks of rain.                     
